{"id":"00149","root":"uni00149_1","name":{"ja":"篠原　まり","en":"Shinohara Mari"},"title":{"ja":"【クリスマス娘】","en":"【Christmas Girl】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【クリスマス娘】 篠原　まり","en":"【Christmas Girl】 Shinohara Mari"},"element":"Natural","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin"],"release":"2018-12-14","limited":true,"characterId":43,"profile":{"ja":"五車学園に通っている1年生。ふうま小太郎やゆきかぜとは別のクラスで 委員長をしている。対魔忍の中でもバカ力の持ち主で、土遁の術を使うことができ、自身の拳と土遁を掛け合わせた 戦闘を得意としている。 また彼女の持って生まれた力を更に発揮する為に 彼女専用の武器が用意される。彼女が使う拳の武器には新型試作兵器である 巻物弾が装填できる。巻物弾1つに対し1つの技が封じられ それを装填し使用することで土遁以外の技を使うことが可能になっている。明るく笑顔が似合うが少しドジでおっちょこちょいな性格。ずば抜けた身体能力を持っているにも関わらず、なにかドジをしてしまうところがたまにある。","en":"Shinohara Mari, she/her: She is a first-year student at Gosha Academy. In a different class from Fuuma Kotaro and Mizuki Yukikaze, she serves as class president. Among Taimanin, she possesses brute strength and can use earth-style ninjutsu, favoring combat that blends her fists with earth techniques. To further unleash her innate power, a weapon made just for her has been prepared. Her fist weapon can be loaded with experimental \"scroll bullets.\" Each scroll bullet seals a technique; loading and firing it lets her use abilities beyond earth-style ninjutsu. She is bright and always wears a smile, though a bit clumsy and prone to mishaps despite her extraordinary physical abilities."},"illustrator":"ぽ～しょん","voiceActor":"藤井ねここ","forms":[{"id":"uni00149_1","rarity":2,"rarityLabel":"R","levelMax":50,"stats":{"hp":[752,1504],"sp":[160,160],"atk":[118,236],"def":[92,184],"spd":[63,63],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":33,"skills":["4","70009"]},{"id":"uni00149_2","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[1104,2208],"sp":[230,230],"atk":[186,372],"def":[134,268],"spd":[63,63],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":33,"skills":["4","70009","70010"]},{"id":"uni00149_3","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1456,2914],"sp":[320,320],"atk":[254,509],"def":[176,351],"spd":[63,63],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":33,"skills