text":{"ja":"んっ……。このサンタ衣装って、ちょっぴりエッチですよね。これ、誰が用意してくれたんでしょう……","en":"Hmm… This Santa outfit is a bit sexy, isn't it? I wonder who prepared this…"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00149_1/uni00149_1_hom_3.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":4,"text":{"ja":"せっかくのクリスマス会、しっかり楽しみましょうね♪","en":"Let's really enjoy the Christmas party!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00149_1/uni00149_1_hom_4.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":5,"text":{"ja":"こういう、クリスマスの雰囲気っていいですよねぇ。ワクワクしちゃいます♪","en":"This kind of Christmas atmosphere is nice, huh? It gets me all excited♪"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00149_1/uni00149_1_hom_5.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":6,"text":{"ja":"あ、あの、さっきは……ううん、やっぱりなんでもないです。無理に思い出すことはないですからね？","en":"Um, about earlier… no, never mind. There's no need to force yourself to remember, okay?"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00149_1/uni00149_1_hom_6.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":7,"text":{"ja":"それにしても、さっきのは気持ちよかったなぁ……。まさか、最後に気を失っちゃうとは思いませんでしたけど","en":"Anyway, that felt good… I never thought I'd lose consciousness at the end."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00149_1/uni00149_1_hom_7.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00149_1/uni00149_1_atk_1.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00149_1/uni00149_1_atk_2.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":3,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00149_1/uni00149_1_atk_3.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00149_1/uni00149_1_dmg_1.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00149_1/uni00149_1_dmg_2.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":3,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00149_1/uni00149_1_dmg_3.ogg"},{"type":"evo","label":"Awakening","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio